<title>JAPAN: JGB market in Tokyo closed for national holiday.</title>
<headline>JGB market in Tokyo closed for national holiday.</headline>
<text>
<p>*Japanese government bond market in Tokyo closed for national</p>
<p>holiday on Tuesday.</p>
<p>*Trade will resume on Wednesday.</p>
<p>*Yield of benchmark 182nd JGB closed at 2.295 percent on</p>
<p>Monday, up from 2.265 percent on last Friday.</p>
</text>
